+"""Bounded adaptive-state microkernel for Exp5859.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-LEARN-5859, SCENARIO-LEARN-5859-PRECONDITIONS,
+SCENARIO-LEARN-5859-OPERATION-PARITY,
